title: "AIAPA_ising: reproduction of a spin scale-aware self-adaptive Ising annealing processing architecture"
abstract: >-
  RTL (Verilog) and an algorithm-level reference model (Python) for the AIAPA
  Ising annealing processor, evaluated on the MaxCut benchmark instance G20.
